                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Wait",
                    "sub": "Retry-After or backoff",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Attempts left?",
                    "sub": "else give up",
                    "ink": "red"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Idempotency and webhooks",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "One ==Idempotency-Key== per logical POST, reused on every retry",
                "Server returns the stored result for repeats",
                "Webhook: verify ==HMAC== on the **raw body**, return 2xx fast, queue work",
                "Dedupe by event ID"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Mistake",
              "text": "Instant 429 retries worsen overload; a new key per retry duplicates the POST."
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Why jitter?** Clients stop retrying in lockstep.",
                "**Why the raw body?** Re-serialised JSON changes the signed bytes."
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed"
            }
          ]
        }
