              "type": "qa",
              "q": "Fixed window, limit 100/min. A client sends 100 requests at 12:00:59 and 100 more at 12:01:00. How many get through?",
              "a_bullets": [
                "All 200: they land in two different windows.",
                "That is 2x the limit in about a second, the boundary flaw."
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "qa",
              "q": "A POST /charge times out. The client retries with a freshly generated Idempotency-Key each time. What goes wrong?",
              "a_bullets": [
                "The server sees new keys, so it may charge twice.",
                "Create the key once per operation and reuse it on every retry."
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "qa",
              "q": "A webhook handler credits an account on every delivery. Event evt_7 arrives twice. What is the bug?",
              "a_bullets": [
